description:
A page in the dashboard, for example /build, more thorough than the README, telling how the station was made:
- shopping list with every part;
- assembly photos and photos of the finished station;
- notes on how it was built and tested, taken from docs/hardware-log.md: bench tests, problems found and fixes.

Content in Markdown inside the frontend. Before publishing any photo, strip its EXIF data, especially GPS, and check that nothing in it identifies the location (no personal location in the repo).
